          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"cadforge-design-studio\">CADForge Design Studio</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Describe glasses, an enclosure, a bracket, or a clip. Edit the dimensions,\nthen select <strong>Build design</strong> to generate an editable CAD model and measured\ngeometry checks. Every dimension is in millimeters.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The four sliders override those dimensions in your request. Other dimensions\ncan be written as <code>board_width=30 mm</code> or <code>camera_diameter=8 mm</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
